// The message topics ECCE uses, by how far they reach (MqttTopicMap,
// src/util/jms/MqttLink.C):
//   FILTER BY: SESSION  one session: ecce/<user>/session/<host>_<id>/<topic>,
//                       the key of Ecce::sessionKey() (#233)
//   FILTER BY: NONE     every session of the user: ecce/<user>/<topic>
//   FILTER BY: USER     the same topic level as NONE
// Any other FILTER BY name counts as SESSION (8.x files say
// USER:HOSTNAME:DISPLAY).
//
// Comments can be added by starting a line with // or #

